From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Codex <codex@openai.com>
Date: Tue, 17 Nov 2026 23:11:47 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 03/22] media: venus: add split MSM8226 register and bandwidth
 support

Keep the wrapper clock selector under exclusive IOMMU ownership. Preserve the other bits when selecting the wrapper clock and check the readback before SCC context or bandwidth-fetch programming. Use stock MMCC rates, codec register presets, bandwidth thresholds and nonsecure IOVA window limits. Platform tables are based on the Linux Foundation downstream MSM8226 source. Require actual interconnect handles before codec startup.
---
